# BAWAAL UI baseline (locked)

This is the **finalized visual baseline**. Do **not** alter these layout structures or re-introduce stripped UI. Further work builds on this state only.

## 1. Camera (`UniversalCamera.tsx` + ChallengeCam)

- **Keep:** Cancel/Close, Flip, shutter only (plus existing duration/hub flows as already present on UniversalCamera).
- **Keep:** Minimalist shutter — animated spinning dotted ring around a solid red center.
- **Keep:** Native pinch-to-zoom on the UniversalCamera surface (works while recording).
- **Speed / slow-mo:** preview-only (`PreviewScreen.tsx` / ClipPreviewModal) — never on the live lens.
- **Never re-add:** zoom preset pills (1× / 2× / 3×), flash toggle, floating speed badges, slow-mo capture overlay/rails, or other redundant viewfinder chrome.
- Full contract: `.cursor/rules/bawaal-challengecam-locked.mdc`.

## 2. Arena header & feed discovery (`ArenaFeed.js` + V2 chrome)

- **Keep:** Main Arena as a single clutter-free video feed.
- **Keep:** V2 header (`ArenaV2Header`) — combined logo + `ARENA` + `▶ GAME ON` + bell. Full contract: `.cursor/rules/bawaal-v2-arena-ui-locked.mdc`.
- **Keep:** Battle-tier + sports filters inside the **GAME ON** drawer (not under the header).
- **Keep:** Inline horizontal **LIVE COMMUNITY CHALLENGES** shelf every 4–5 feed items **after** leading videos (`CommunityChallengesShelf`) deep-linking to BATTLES.
- **Keep:** Open Callouts (OPEN CHALLENGES | TIPS & BREAKDOWNS) on the **BATTLES** tab via `OpenCalloutsPanel`.
- **Never re-add:** header `⋮`, under-header tier pills, live-score tickers / `ScoresSportsPanel` on Arena.

## 3. Video feed surfaces (`SportsFeedPlaceholder.js` feed variant, Arena reel cards)

- **Keep:** Clean media — **no** sport category pills (e.g. KABADDI, COURT KINGS, FOOTBALL) on the video/placeholder surface.
- **Never re-add** red/accent bordered category tag rows on feed clips.

## 4. Bottom navigation (`CustomTabBar.js` + `MainTabs.js`)

- **Keep:** Full-width row with `justifyContent: 'space-around'` (or equivalent even spacing).
- **Keep:** Labels ARENA, BATTLES, LOCKER ROOM, PASSPORT readable without character wrap/clip; central BATTLE FAB in a fixed center slot that does not squeeze side tabs.
- **Do not** shrink the bar into an icon-only strip or reintroduce overlapping/clipped Passport text.

## Allowed changes

- New features, data, navigation targets, and non-UI logic **behind** or **alongside** this chrome.
- Bugfixes that preserve the locked look (e.g. safe-area padding) without restoring removed controls.
